      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW ALLESANDRA (8) is better than last start when sixth (22.40) from Box 8 at Ballarat over 390m. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from seven starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. BRINDLE ROAD (1) missed the frame latest but had been racing well prior to that including a Grade 6 win two back (23.66) at this track. Rates a winning chance on best. HEAD FOR HOME (7) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by 3.5 lengths at Murray Bridge in a handy 16.60 beating El Rey. Winner at his latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. In great recent form and expected to measure up again. AGENT TWENTY ONE (2) hit the frame latest (23.45) when second at this track in a Grade 5. Has already won four times from this draw.",
